"iPadPro13M5Cellular-iPadPro13M5Cellular","iPhone17e-iPhone17e","iPadAir11M4-iPadAir11M4","iPadAir11M4Cellular-iPadAir11M4Cellular","iPadAir13M4-iPadAir13M4","iPadAir13M4Cellular-iPadAir13M4Cellular","iPhone18Pro-iPhone18Pro","iPhone18ProMax-iPhone18ProMax","iPhoneDuo-iPhoneDuo","iPadMiniA20Pro-iPadMiniA20Pro","iPadMiniA20ProCellular-iPadMiniA20ProCellular"],"fileSizeBytes":"245340160","formattedPrice":"Free","userRatingCountForCurrentVersion":822,"sellerUrl":"https://www.skistar.com/sv/myskistar/appar/","trackContentRating":"4+","averageUserRatingForCurrentVersion":4.23723,"languageCodesISO2A":["DA","EN","DE","NB","SV"],"trackCensoredName":"SkiStar","trackViewUrl":"https://apps.apple.com/no/app/skistar/id406481077?uo=4","contentAdvisoryRating":"4+","averageUserRating":4.23723,"artistId":406481080,"artistName":"SkiStar AB","genres":["Travel"],"price":0.0,"isVppDeviceBasedLicensingEnabled":true,"sellerName":"Skistar AB","releaseDate":"2010-12-08T01:43:06Z","genreIds":["6003"],"minimumOsVersion":"16.6","currentVersionReleaseDate":"2026-11-12T08:46:02Z","releaseNotes":"More time on the slopes, less time searching. We've improved your bookings and refreshed the information about your destination to make your stay smoother, from arrival to après-ski.\n\nInformation is now tailored to your stay, so you'll see what's most relevant at the right time. This applies both when preparing for your trip and during your days at the destination. Your bookings are now gathered in one place and easier to find, and we've added a few handy features to make planning your day a little easier.\n\nAs always, we've also made some small improvements and bug fixes behind the scenes. We hope you enjoy the update, and see you on the slopes!","version":"9.2.2","wrapperType":"software","currency":"NOK","description":"Welcome to the world of SkiStar\n\nHere you can receive information and offers from all our destinations all year round. It's easy to see today's weather and get tips on activities, restaurants and shops. You can also get to know your children's best friend, Valle the Snowman.\n \nBuy winter SkiPass or summer LiftPass cards from the app and pick them up in an automatic dispenser. You can also refill the cards you already have and pay with Swish in Sweden.\n \nMaps will give you a quick overview of open lifts and pistes, as well as biking and hiking trails, and you can also keep track of where your friends are.\n \nYou can see your active booking and everything you need to know about your lodging, your SkiPass/LiftPass, rental products and booked activities.\n \nBy linking your SkiPass, you can collect skiing statistics, chase pins and compete on our leader boards during the winter.\n \nWe wish you a pleasant stay!","bundleId":"com.skistar.SKISTAR1","trackId":406481077,"trackName":"SkiStar","primaryGenreName":"Travel","primaryGenreId":6003,"userRatingCount":822}